WEBVTT

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.510
Summer Vacation (Part Two)

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.790
Cherry Blossom
Jelly

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.790
Green Tea
Rice Cake

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.790
Polka-Dot
Jelly

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.790
Azuki bean
ice cream inside

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.290
You drew so many.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.800
Cat Confection

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.800
Goldfish Jelly
(soda flavor)

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.800
Starry Sky
Gelatin

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.800
Japanese White-Eye
Confection

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:15.300
They're so beautiful and look delicious.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.050
I know, right?

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.550
The striped jelly is cute, isn't it?

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:22.640
And the jelly balls
look like drops of water, right?

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:28.810
CRESCENT MOON

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.360
Grandpa said we could
do it again next year.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:38.280
Actually, I'd like to do it for the summer festival
and New Year's holiday as well.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.960
But I've got this mountain of homework.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:46.960
HEAPING

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.790
All these ideas for sweets
are popping up in my head,

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:56.840
but I have a ton of homework and mandatory
school days during summer vacation!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:05.350
This is actually a lot.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.140
Yeah.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.480
We're in the third-year,
but since a lot of things happened in class,

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.490
homeroom really fell behind.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.790
So...

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:42.260
Rei, how old were you when you first
wanted to become a professional shogi player?

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:02.950
Well...

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.910
I think I was in fourth grade.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:20.760
No.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.390
That's not right.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.180
That's not quite right.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:33.400
At some point, I realized
this was the only path left for me.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.480
Or rather...

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:40.280
This was the only thing I knew how to do.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.280
Oh, that's right.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:50.290
Hina, you love your Grandpa's shop,
so you want to help out there, right?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.580
Yeah.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:59.420
There are lots of things I want to do right now
and they're right in front of me,

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.880
but I can't touch them,
which makes me feel sad.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:06.300
Or maybe it's just that I want a distraction.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:12.100
From the mountain of homework,
tests, entrance exams...

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:20.320
People say to choose a high school, but I can't
even picture myself as a high school student.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:24.820
I don't even know
if things will go well for me there.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:29.830
Joining another group of people
I don't know is...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.790
I guess I can't really explain it.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:48.720
Hina, if you'd like, and if you're free
this Saturday...

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.230
Flowers, it's flowers!

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.490
Kiriyama!

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.580
It's a nice clear day, isn't it?

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.750
Hoh Hoh Hoh

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:18.250
Thank you very much for inviting us today.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:18.250
DEEP BOW

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.000
Hello, Teacher.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.630
Welcome.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:27.630
YIKES

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.630
When I let my guard down,
the obvious misunderstanding happened!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:31.890
It's okay. Please enjoy yourselves.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.900
The theme is
"Gravity and the Energy of Water."

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:46.150
This is the culmination of the Shogi Science Club's
summer research project, Flume Noodles!

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.660
Wow! This is the first time I've seen one!

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.780
Look, Momo!
This is flume noodles!

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.040
I love slippery food!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.540
MUHAAA

00:06:56.710 --> 00:07:00.710
Actually, part of the bamboo thicket
in my yard had to be cut away

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.790
to make room for an addition to my house,

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.590
so I thought I better take advantage
and make use of it.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.800
HA
HA
HA
HA

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.180
Hey!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.680
HEAP

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:12.680
I boiled the noodles!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.180
Here's the first batch.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.560
Oh, Mr. Hayashida, let me introduce you.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:22.230
Hello. Thank you for letting us visit.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.230
BOW...

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.900
I'm Hinata Kawamoto.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:28.700
Um, and this is my little sister, Momo.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:31.780
Ah, yes, hello!

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.700
GASP

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:34.580
<i>I see!</i>

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:38.710
- Hey Hina, I want to eat now!
- Okay.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:38.290
<i>This is the girl Kiriyama was worried about!</i>

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:42.000
<i>Sh-She really is cute!</i>

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.960
<i>Kiriyama!</i>

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.960
AWW

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.920
We're going to get things flowing!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.590
Make sure you eat your fill!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:49.840
Right, Kiriyama?

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.220
Hey, Kiriyama!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:51.970
JAB JAB

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.470
<i>She's such a cute girl</i>

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.090
JAB JAB

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:54.220
JAB JAB

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:58.730
<i>that even a straight-laced guy like Kiriyama
would plunge into the atmosphere of love!</i>

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:55.350
JAB JAB

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:56.470
JAB JAB

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:57.600
JAB JAB

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:58.730
JAB JAB

00:07:58.730 --> 00:07:59.850
<i>I understand!</i>

00:07:59.100 --> 00:07:59.850
JAB JAB

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.560
Oh my, it's so bittersweet!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.980
<i>What will I do with him? Sheesh!</i>

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:10.240
GRIND GRIND

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:09.690
Mr. Hayashida, um, that hurts.

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.530
Sorry I'm late!

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.990
Cooking the tempura took a long time!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.910
It's so hot.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.500
DISHEVELED

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:27.500
SWEAT-
SOAKED

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:42.190
Oh, are you the teacher?

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:44.900
Thank you for always taking good care of Rei.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:48.150
And thank you for inviting us here today.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:53.030
DEEP
BOW

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:50.650
Oh wow, tempura?

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:53.780
Everyone will be so pleased.
Thank you so much.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:57.410
And how beautiful!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.870
Please, come this way!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.750
The situation has naturally become
more complicated again!

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.420
Wait, um, Mr. Hayashida?

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:09.550
FROZEN

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.550
Your face looks like it's made of red clay!

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:12.800
There!

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:15.300
It looks delicious!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.640
Oh, Mr. Hayashida. What's wrong?

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:25.560
Your face is the color of oxidized iron.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.520
Maybe you have heatstroke?

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.780
All right, here we go!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.290
Is everybody ready?

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:45.290
SERIOUS

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.290
Then we'll start with the kids!

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.050
DAZED

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:59.300
Ease up on the water!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.430
Lower the bamboo chute too!

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:05.730
The child's eyes can't capture
the noodles properly!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.440
Her eyes are swimming!

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.910
It's a struggle, eh, miss?

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.540
Instead of aiming for it,
the trick is to wait for it.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.540
I see!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.930
Yummy!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.930
The tempura is yummy too!

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:45.930
This is fun! Yay!

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:49.690
Sense of
Accomplishment

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.690
YES

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.690
Okay! It's now time for the long-awaited...

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:53.940
BA-BAAAM

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.690
starving-man time!

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.690
SERIOUS

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:57.450
Here we go!

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:58.200
GRAB

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.240
Here.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.410
WHOOSH

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.120
That's fast!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:03.660
WHIZ

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.660
- Wait!
- I can't see it!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:04.660
ZOOM

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.790
I got a pink one! I got a pink one!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.920
PINK

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.920
Yes! Woo!

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.420
- I did it!
- For pink, you get chicken tempura.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.340
Chicken tempura.

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:17.300
Green! I got a green one!

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:18.680
Bzzt!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.140
Green is nothing.

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:20.930
What?

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:23.300
Please go to the end of the line.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:27.810
A pink one!

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.060
I'll go get my chicken tempura!

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.190
Um, excuse me!

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.360
SWISH

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.190
NOTHING

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:37.070
Nothing's flowing down here!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:42.410
I got another pink!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.200
Hey, hey, let me eat too!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.330
I'm the one who boiled all these noodles!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.790
- Delicious!
- The chicken tempura is great!

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.460
Damn it!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:56.460
Hey, let me get at least one. Just one is fine!
Let one come to me!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:58.590
Mr. Hayashida, you haven't gotten anything.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.720
Rei looks like he's having fun!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:06.100
Yeah. A lot of fun.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.560
This is nice. I didn't know
there were fun high schools like this.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.310
Yes! Chicken tempura!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:17.570
Yeah.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.070
- I've got it, Hina.
- Maybe...

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.700
- Why don't you try to get into this school?
- I should try to get into this school.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.080
Oh, I got one!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.210
Are you sure it's not a green one?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:43.010
Summer Vacation (Part Two)

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:47.010
New Year

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:50.770
SUMIYOSHI SHRINE

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.740
<i>Early January of the following year.</i>

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.660
Question 30
Using the below figure, find ∠x.
However, BA=BC,
ℓ, m are parallel.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.920
<i>Entrance exams are coming up.</i>

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.920
STRETCH

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.920
HMMMM

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.810
TSUME-SHOGI

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:43.780
H-Hey... Um, Rei.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:49.700
About this figure...

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:55.460
SLIDE

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.710
Is this...

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:05.220
Let's see here.

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:11.220
Oh, for this, you should draw
an additional line.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.230
A-Around where should I draw it?

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:18.230
First try drawing it
in the loneliest-looking spot.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:26.240
COZY
COZY

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:23.190
<i>That's right. I decided my first choice</i>

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:26.240
<i>would be Komahashi Private High School,
where Rei goes.</i>

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.990
<i>He's been helping me study like this.</i>

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.500
<i>"I want to go to Hashi High."</i>

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.250
<i>The first time I said that to Rei...</i>

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.580
What? Hashi High? Really, Hina?

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.130
WHAAAT

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:48.640
WHAAAT

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:48.640
<i>For some reason, he was extremely happy.</i>

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:54.140
U-Um, I don't know if I'll get in yet.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:58.310
Um, I haven't even
been going to a cram school.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:09.410
<i>The next day,
Rei came over with a "study plan."</i>

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.780
FIX

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.780
SERIOUS

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.780
We have plenty of time.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:15.200
If we start preparing now,
you'll definitely be all right!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:23.710
<i>Since then, he's been supervising my studies
several times a week after having dinner here.</i>

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:29.760
I-I think I'm starting to get the hang of it.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.720
Yeah, I think I've got it.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:37.930
Right? You can only get a feel for math
by solving problems over and over.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:41.440
You'll be fine if you stay calm
and solve them one at a time.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:43.610
Right. I'll do my best!

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:51.200
<i>Rei is a patient teacher, which makes this
easy to understand, and I'm really grateful.</i>

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:51.700
ZZZ
ZZZ

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:58.830
PING

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:01.710
I-Is this a late-night snack I'm sensing?

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:08.090
PEEK

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:08.090
Hello. Do we have anyone here
who would like to be pampered?

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:08.670
GASP

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:10.930
Wait, could that be...

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:11.510
RATTLE

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.600
Yes! Yes, I want to be pampered!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.800
Pampered?

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.810
Hup!

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.390
STEAMING

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:19.730
Ta-daaa!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:29.320
Here you are.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:36.330
SIMMER
SIMMER

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:36.330
STEAMING

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.910
Fried tofu and tempura together as toppings.

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.330
SWEET

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:42.170
Th-This is the Kawamoto family's
legendary "Pampered Udon"!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.550
Melting tempura that's been
deep-fried to fluffiness...

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:55.100
next to sweet fried tofu
permeated with sizzling broth!

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.560
Something delicious
right next to something delicious!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:03.350
MMM...
HEARTRENDING...

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:02.980
It makes me too happy!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.610
Pampered Udon...

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:11.280
D-Delicious!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.710
<i>So, which do you want with the udon,
fried tofu or tempura?</i>

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:25.210
<i>I can't choose!</i>

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:29.130
And so, to erase her daughter's troubles,

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.420
she came up with
the cockamamie idea of using "both."

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:32.800
She called it...

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:33.300
HEE

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:33.680
HEE
HEE

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:34.260
HEE
HEE
HEE

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.510
Pampered Udon!

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:43.940
Mom often made it for me as a late-night snack
when I was studying for entrance exams.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:47.020
Eating that always made me really happy.

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:56.280
And I wanted to make it for you when it was
your turn to study for exams, Hina.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:02.660
Thanks. This makes me happy.
It's so delicious!

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.750
Well, I guess you have a little longer to go.

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:14.420
I left the heat on for the bath,
so turn it off when you're done.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.680
Okay, thank you. Goodnight!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:33.780
<i>When I first thought I wanted to go
to the same private high school as Rei,</i>

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.950
<i>it was only the feeling of "I want to go."</i>

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:41.330
<i>I didn't know if it was okay to be selfish.</i>

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:50.590
<i>When we set up a stand in the summer,
it made me think.</i>

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:54.590
BLACK PEARL
TAPIOCA

00:18:54.590 --> 00:19:00.100
RICE
FLOUR

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:08.230
CRESCENT MOON

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:18.990
<i>Within these small sweets
that cost 250 yen apiece,</i>

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:25.250
<i>how much time, labor, and money
has gone in to them?</i>

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:31.540
<i>Starting at dawn, Grandpa stands in front of
the stove on days he cooks bean jam.</i>

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:38.840
<i>How much money is left for Grandpa
from one of those sweets?</i>

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.810
<i>And if I went to a private high school,</i>

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:53.230
<i>how many sweets
would Grandpa have to make?</i>

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:01.160
Go to Komahashi High School.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.160
B-But...

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:10.040
You girls worked really hard
with the stand this summer.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:15.130
From calculating the cost to production
to sales to the end, you did a great job.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.550
But you're worried about something.

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:24.430
You're thinking how much income is left
for Grandpa after making these sweets, right?

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:35.440
"Kids don't need to think about that stuff."
That's not how I feel.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:41.700
Money is precious. That's very important.

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:48.950
And I'm impressed you realized that.

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:53.080
But Hina.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.080
CLANG

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:57.340
You better not underestimate this Grandpa!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.340
GRIN

00:20:57.800 --> 00:21:01.130
There are people waiting for my sweets.

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:05.850
CRESCENT MOON

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:06.930
And I still have plenty of will left
to tussle with that bean jam!

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:10.350
You want to go because
that school would be fun.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.100
That one reason is okay by me!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:19.610
Whether or not you're enjoying your life
is what matters the most to me.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:23.990
Grandpa.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.030
But, hey, there's another thing.

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.870
Your sister and I looked into a few things.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:35.330
Apparently Komahashi High School,
where the kid goes, is really tough to get into.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.710
AUGH

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.170
Are you going to be able to get in?

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:43.090
Ahh, g-good question.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:43.090
SHAKE
SHAKE

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.310
<i>I'll do my best. I'll work hard.</i>

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:55.770
<i>I'll study hard and get into that school!</i>

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:03.990
Um, Rei, I've got a question about this one.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:07.320
Rei.

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:14.250
TSUME-SHOGI

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:27.260
<i>When Rei is solving tsume-shogi problems,
he gets quiet and absorbed.</i>

00:22:28.550 --> 00:22:32.560
<i>The mood was infectious,
enabling me to have incredible concentration.</i>

00:22:36.060 --> 00:22:40.520
<i>It was unusually silent,
so I opened the curtain.</i>

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:43.030
<i>Outside the window...</i>

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:52.330
<i>was this year's first snow.</i>

00:22:57.040 --> 00:23:00.040
New Year

00:24:30.010 --> 00:24:32.010
Next Episode Preview

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:37.560
Episode 43

00:24:32.470 --> 00:24:35.060
Five more days
until the entrance exam.

00:24:35.060 --> 00:24:37.560
Call me if you want me
to do anything.

00:24:37.560 --> 00:24:39.350
I'll be right next to you.

00:24:39.350 --> 00:24:43.270
Shikoku. That's so far away.

00:24:43.270 --> 00:24:45.110
What the hell am I doing?

00:24:45.110 --> 00:24:50.030
Mom, Grandma...
Please watch over Hina.

00:24:50.030 --> 00:24:59.040
ILLUSTRATION:
NAO IWAMOTO

00:24:51.150 --> 00:24:52.990
The best late-night snack
for entrance exam students is...

00:24:52.990 --> 00:24:54.200
Udon, right?

00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:56.700
It digests quickly
and is easy on the stomach.
